<http://example.org/dengue/qa114> a ex:QA_Pair ;
    ex:answer_english "Only need to undergo symptomatic treatment, take paractemol to handle fever, get rest and drink enough water daily.Maintains good urinary habits, and receives clinical examination and blood analysis to monitor the body's condition." ;
    ex:answer_malay "Hanya perlu menjalani rawatan simtomatik, mengambil Paractemol untuk mengendali demam, mendapat rehat and minum air yang mencukupi setiap hari. Mengekalkan tabiat kencing yang baik, dan menerima pemeriksaan klinikal dan analisis darah untuk memantau keadaan badan." ;
    ex:category 3 ;
    ex:question_english "what kind of treatment for light conditions" ;
