<http://example.org/dengue/qa116> a ex:QA_Pair ;
    ex:answer_english """~ Clean your surroundings from a condition that promotes mosquito breeding.
~ Wear clothes that can cover your body as much as possible.
~ Use an insect repellent, sleep under the mosquito net, close the door and window or make sure the net is installed.""" ;
    ex:answer_malay """~ Bersihkan persekitaran anda daripada keadaan yang menggalakkan pembiakan nyamuk.
~ Pakai pakaian yang boleh menutupi badan anda sebanyak mungkin.
~ Gunakan penghalau serangga, tidur di bawah kelambu, tutup pintu dan tingkap atau pastikan jaring dipasang.""" ;
    ex:category 4 ;
    ex:question_english "how to prevent dengue" ;
    ex:question_malay "bagaimana cegah denggi" ;
    ex:source "https://www.pantai.com.my/ms/health-pulse/dengue-fever#:~:text=Denggi%20tidak%20berjangkit%20daripada%20manusia,rawatan%20perubatan%20segera%20adalah%20penting." .

<http://example.org/dengue/qa117> a ex:QA_Pair ;
    ex:answer_english """~ Prevent Aedes mosquitoes from breeding.
~ Cover the door and window or install the net.
~ Use a mosquito repellent.
~ Eliminate adult mosquitoes.
~ Wear protective clothing.
~ Time to get out.""" ;
    ex:answer_malay """~ Mengelakkan nyamuk Aedes daripada membiak.
~ Tutup pintu dan tingkap atau pasang jaring.
~ Gunakan penghalau nyamuk.
~ Hapuskan nyamuk dewasa.
~ Pakai pakaian pelindung.
~ Atur waktu untuk anda keluar.""" ;
    ex:category 4 ;
    ex:question_english "what is the way to prevent dengue outbreaks at home" ;
    ex:question_malay "apakah cara mencegah wabak denggi di rumah" ;
    ex:source "https://www.pantai.com.my/ms/health-pulse/dengue-fever#:~:text=Denggi%20tidak%20berjangkit%20daripada%20manusia,rawatan%20perubatan%20segera%20adalah%20penting." .

<http://example.org/dengue/qa118> a ex:QA_Pair ;
    ex:answer_english "Cleaning residential areas from mosquito breeding grounds." ;
    ex:answer_malay "Membersihkan kawasan kediaman daripada tempat pembiakan nyamuk." ;
    ex:category 4 ;
    ex:question_english "how to prevent dengue fever" ;
    ex:question_malay "bagaimana cegah demam denggi" ;
