<http://example.org/dengue/qa121> a ex:QA_Pair ;
    ex:answer_english """~ Destroy mosquito breeding grounds.
~ Wear a mosquito net for sleep at night if necessary.
~ Use an insect spray.
~ Use clothes with long arms.
~ Close the house window early especially at dusk and dawn.""" ;
    ex:answer_malay """~ Musnahkan tempat pembiakan nyamuk.
