<http://example.org/dengue/qa51> a ex:QA_Pair ;
    ex:answer_english """~ High fever is up to 40 degrees Celsius.
~ Severe headache or pain in the back of the eyes.
~ Joint pain, muscle or bone.
~ Gums and bleeding nose.
~ Easily bruised.
~ Low white blood cells.""" ;
    ex:answer_malay """~ Demam tinggi mendadak hingga 40 darjah Celcius.
